c6i.xlarge isn't on the burst-bucket model; its baseline EBS throughput should be roughly 74 MB/s at 6250 IOPS, but volume 0690 showed 131 MB/s, which doesn't fit, and ebs-optimized is actually false for that instance. It's possible those volumes were attached to a different instance at the time, so I should query the EC2 metrics directly to confirm.

